## OllamaProxy: operator working copy (live config)
# appsettings.json is the LIVE operator configuration the admin UI rewrites at runtime; it
# holds real backend URLs and plaintext API keys, so it must never be committed. The tracked,
# never-loaded appsettings.reference.json is the annotated manual and factory-reset baseline
# (a different filename, so the rules below do not match it — it stays under version control).
# appsettings.Development.json is the historical dev override and is ignored for the same reason.
appsettings.json
**/appsettings.json
appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Development.json

## Local development overrides that may contain secrets
appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
secrets.json

